# Build-context size and speed: every path not excluded here is uploaded to the
# daemon before the build starts. The image itself only ever contains what the
# build stage emits into client/dist, so nothing below can leak into it either
# way - this is about not shipping 15MB to the builder to ignore most of it.

.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
compose.yaml
.github
.vscode
k8s

# Installed and rebuilt inside the image; a host copy would be the wrong
# platform's binaries anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite

# Secrets. Not tracked by git either, but a build context is assembled from the
# working directory rather than from git, so it has to be named here too.
**/.env

# The API is a separate service with its own deployment - this image is the
# frontend only.
server

# The pre-MERN app, still in the repository root and still runnable, but not
# what gets built or served any more. The root audio/ directory is the same
# 7.4MB as client/public/audio, and only the latter reaches the build.
audio
index.html
app.js
audio.js
analytics.js
instruments.js
tabla.js
taal_data.js
tanpura-dsp.js
tanpura-worker.js
style.css
icon.svg
icon-*.png
.nojekyll

# Working notes and local output - not served, not shipped.
*.md
server_log.txt
*.apk
*.log
